#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:261
msgid "All Roles"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:163
msgid ""
"By selecting \"All Roles\" or individual roles for each widget, you can "
"define widget existence with full granularity. Once you press \"Submit...\", "
"your selection is stored and executed. Any role selection will be stored for "
"later use, regardless, whether the related widget was checked to disappear "
"or not."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:165
msgid ""
"Checking \"Select/Deselect all\" will select or deselect all dashboard "
"widgets. Again, all selected dashboard widgets and their list items will be "
"highlighted (if currently visible)."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:249
msgid "Click = toggle highlight"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:221
msgid "Context"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:219
msgid "Context, ID, Title and Priorities"
msgstr ""

#. Name of the plugin
#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:158 dashboard-widgets-control.php:190
msgid "Dashboard Widgets Control"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Displays all registered dashboard widgets and enables to remove them "
"individually for all or for selected roles in order to avoid irritation of "
"clients or other site contributors. When checked indiviually, the dashboard "
"widgets and their related list-items will be highlighted for identification "
"of unknown widget names."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:221
msgid "For Roles"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:277
msgid "Hint"
msgstr ""

#. URI of the plugin
msgid "https://de.wordpress.org/plugins/dashboard-widgets-control/"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:167
msgid ""
"If needed, the table can be moved horizontally on small screens, using "
"touchscreen swipe or keyboard left/right arrows, once clicked"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:160
msgid ""
"In order to have full administration control, this plugin will ensure "
"visibility of all dashboard widgets, regardless the display options settings."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:219
msgid "List of Registered Dashboard Widgets"
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Michael Finkenberger"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:162
msgid ""
"Once a checkbox is individually checked, the list item and the related "
"dashboard widget will be highlighted (if currently visible) in order to "
"identify unknown widget names."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:288
msgid "Please submit once to activate"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:169
msgid "Plugin Version"
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:164
msgid ""
"Pressing \"Reset...\" will reset the form to its initial state when the page "
"was loaded. Other than upon page load, all selected dashboard widgets and "
"their respective list item will be highlighted (if currently visible)."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard-widgets-control.php:166
msgid ""
"Pressing an individual widget ID table cell or the little target symbol in "
"the dashboard widget header will toggle the highlighting of list items and "
"related dashboard widgets (if currently visible) to reveal unknown widget "
"names."
msgstr ""

